SUMMARY:HLS Global Development Consulting Applications Due
DESCRIPTION:GDC is a multidisciplinary\, student-led consulting program w
 here IU students from across majors and class years work in teams on real
 -world international development projects. Consultants collaborate with g
 lobal partner organizations\, tackle complex challenges\, and gain hands-
 on experience that goes far beyond the classroom.Through GDC\, you can:Wo
 rk on real international development projects  Collaborate with organizat
 ions and partners around the world  Build consulting\, research\, project
  management\, and communication skills  Learn about global challenges acr
 oss regions and sectors  Join a multidisciplinary community of students f
 rom across IU  Grow into leadership roles over multiple years in the Lab 
  No prior consulting or international development experience is required.
  If you're curious about global issues and want to put your skills to wor
 k on meaningful projects\, come learn what GDC is all about.  **must be a
 ble to attend weekly meetings on Fridays from 1:55-3:55  Ready to apply? 
 Click here (https://forms.gle/8RUQUNADfZG6QjR16)
