SUMMARY:Academic Poster Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join the HLS Graduate Peer Mentors for a hands-on Academic Po
 ster Workshop designed to help you develop\, revise\, and strengthen your
  research poster.  Bring your poster draft\, work in progress\, or resear
 ch materials and use this session to work on your poster and receive feed
 back. The workshop is an opportunity to put the principles introduced dur
 ing the October 8 "How to Build Academic Posters" session into practice\,
  but attendance at the earlier workshop is not required.  This workshop w
 ill also help students prepare for the Graduate Student Poster Session at
  the GAP Symposium at HLS on November 7. Whether you have a complete draf
 t or are still developing your poster\, you are welcome to participate.
