DESCRIPTION:Join IKS and the Bloomington Sejong Institute to learn how to
  make the beloved Korean food kimchi!  We are working in partnership with
  Kbap to do a demonstration on the ingredients and methods for making kim
 chi.  Spots are limited.  &#160\;Ingredients\, supplies\, and refreshment
 s will be provided.
