 complex emergency\, Amazon wildfires\, and the Northern Ethiopia response
 .  Skip high-level theory. This session breaks down raw operational trade
 craft: leading cross-agency disaster systems\, managing risk under extrem
 e uncertainty\, and building the personal stamina required for high-stake
 s international careers.  &#160\;
